hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"33","[AI-translation] Haddasana Yusuf bin Isa, qala: haddasana Waki', qala: haddasana Rabi' bin Sabih, ne Yazid bin Aban (yani Raqashi) se, unhone Anas bin Malik se riwayat ki, ke farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sar mein tail lagane aur daadhi kangi karne ki kasrat farmate, aur sar dhanpne (chadar odhne) ki kasrat farmate yahan tak ke goya unka kapda, tel bechne wale ka kapda ho."
"34","[AI-translation] Haddasana Hannad bin As-Sari, qala: haddasana Abu Al-Ahwas, ne Al-Ash'ath bin Abi Ash-Sha'tha'a se, unhone apne waalid se, unhone Masruq se, unhone Aisha (radiyallahu anha) se riwayat ki, ke unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) paaki (wuzu) mein jab paak farmate to daheen taraf se shuru karne ko pasand farmate, aur kangi karne mein jab kangi farmate, aur joota pehanne mein jab joota pehannte."
"35","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishar, qala: haddasana Yahya bin Sa'id, ne Hisham bin Hassan se, unhone Al-Hasan se, unhone Abdullah bin Mughaffal se riwayat ki, ke farmaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kangi karne se mana farmaya, magar ek din chhor kar."
"36","[AI-translation] Haddasana Al-Hasan bin Arfa, qala: haddasana Abdus-Salam bin Harb, ne Yazid bin Abi Khalid se, unhone Abu Al-Ala Al-Awdi se, unhone Humaid bin Abdur-Rahman se, aur unhone Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ek sahabi se riwayat ki ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din chhor kar kangi farmate."
"37","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishar, qala: akhbarana Abu Dawud, qala: akhbarana Hammam, ne Qatada se, ke unhone kaha: Maine Anas bin Malik se poocha: Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne (baalon mein) rang lagaya? Unhone kaha: Wo is tak na pohanche (unhone aisa nahi kiya), balke unke dono gango mein sirf safed baal thay, lekin Abu Bakr ne mehndi aur katem se rang lagaya."
